   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Child with ataxia: a SIGN, not a diagnosis",
   "lines": [
    "cerebellar HEMISPHERE → limbs: over- or undershoots, clumsy · VERMIS → trunk: can't sit, wide-based gait",
    "also from vestibular disease (vertigo, vomiting) or weakness, sensory or position-sense loss",
    "IMAGE (MRI preferred, CT more accessible) if: ANY other neurologic finding · SUBACUTE course · TRAUMA"
   ]
  },
